<title>UK: Norway's Troll crude to load 5.15 mln bls in Aug.</title>
<headline>Norway's Troll crude to load 5.15 mln bls in Aug.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Troll oilfield is scheduled to load 5.15 million barrels of crude oil in August, compared to 7.4 million barrels in July, traders said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>The August programme consists of four cargoes of 400,000 barrels, four of 600,000 barrels and one of 1.15 million barrels, they said.</p>
<p>The 72,000 barrel per day cut in production from July is due to field maintenance scheduled for August, they added.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 5387</p>
</text>
